    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 4 and takes about 1 hour 50 minutes. The critical thing to watch when finishing the sauce is the temperature: once you stir in the egg yolk and cream mixture, the sauce must never boil or the eggs will scramble."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Do not brown the veal at any point. The whole point of this dish is the pale, clean appearance and the delicate flavour it produces. Colour means something went wrong."
          }
        ]
      },
